# Rules for AI coding tools in this repo

The old `.cursorrules` held a 1,300-line copy of the coding rules. The copy drifted (it
named scripts, folders and services that no longer exist), so it was removed. Read the
real rules where they are kept current:

- `AGENTS.md`: the stack today, how work ships, the hard rules. Read it before your first edit.
- `README.md` and `docs/README.md`: the repo map and the index of docs that are kept current.
- The `CLAUDE.md` in the folder you are editing, for example `apps/web/src/ui/CLAUDE.md`
  (UI classes, HMR cleanup), `design-system/CLAUDE.md` (tokens) and `brand/CLAUDE.md`
  (brand guidelines and their index).

Don't add rules here. Add them to `AGENTS.md` or the folder's `CLAUDE.md`, once.
